Output docs/media/capture.gif
Source docs/media/tapes/common.tape

Hide
Type "export ORG_DEMO_DIR=/tmp/org-demo-capture; clear; nvim -u docs/media/demo/init.lua $ORG_DEMO_DIR/notes.org" Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type " oc" Sleep 1.2s
Type "w" Sleep 1.2s
Type "t" Sleep 1.5s
Type "Fix the flaky agenda test" Sleep 1s
Escape Ctrl+C Ctrl+C Sleep 1.2s
Type ":e $ORG_DEMO_DIR/work.org" Enter Sleep 800ms
Shift+Tab Sleep 600ms
Shift+Tab Sleep 1.5s
Sleep 1s
